        <mxCell id="ntrule" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;color:#b94a12&quot;&gt;Event &amp; delivery behavior&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;Consumers create in-app notifications and email jobs for supported contract events. Email sending is asynchronous with bounded attempts and visible Sent/Failed state. MailHog is the local SMTP sink. The exact consumer retry/ACK implementation is in shared EventConsumerBase; it logs/ACKs after configured delivery attempts rather than writing a durable DLQ." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#46556f;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;" vertex="1" parent="1">
