        <mxCell id="rprule" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;color:#b94a12&quot;&gt;Data ownership&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;Report Service is an eventually consistent read model populated from Redis events; it does not join other service databases. Snapshot generation copies aggregate counts and the by-major JSON summary. CSV exports encode UTF-8 BOM for spreadsheet compatibility." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#46556f;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;" vertex="1" parent="1">
